    "type": "Table",
    "diagnosis": "",
    "title": "<p>Essential and desirable diagnostic criteria for desmoplastic infantile astrocytoma (DIA) and desmoplastic infantile ganglioglioma (DIG)</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "Dominique Figarella-Branger",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; \" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\" \">\r\n<td style=\"width: 444.85pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"593\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"\"><em style=\"\">Essential: </em></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 444.85pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"593\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\" \">Biphasic morphology with a dominant desmoplastic leptomeningeal component admixed with a neuroepithelial component containing astrocytic cells only (DIA) or containing astrocytes and neuronal cells (DIG)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 444.85pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"593\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"\"><span style=\"\">AND (for unresolved lesions)</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 36.85pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"49\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\" \"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 408.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"544\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\" \">Methylation profile of DIG/DIA </span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 36.85pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"49\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\" \">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 408.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"544\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"\"><span style=\"\">OR</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 36.85pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"49\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 408.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"544\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em style=\"\"><span style=\"\">BRAF</span></em><span style=\" \"> or </span><em style=\"\"><span style=\"\">RAF1</span></em><span style=\" \"> mutation or fusion, occurring in the absence of homozygous deletion of </span><em style=\"\"><span style=\"\">CDKN2A</span></em><span style=\" \"> and/or </span><em style=\"\"><span style=\"\">CDKN2B</span></em></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 444.85pt; background: #EFF6FC; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"593\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"\"><em style=\"\">Desirable:</em></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 444.85pt; background: #EFF6FC; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"593\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\" \">Tumour with a cystic component and a solid portion, with leptomeningeal involvement, usually attached to the dura</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" \">\r\n<td style=\"width: 444.85pt; background: #EFF6FC; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"593\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\" \">Infantile onset (typically at &lt;&nbsp;24 months)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>",
    "imageUrl": null,
    "thumbnail": null
  },
